{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>To a rugged wadi.</b> Where no foot is commonly found." "<b>And they shall break its neck.</b> For it is a death hidden from the eyes of the slain, indicating that the murder was without doubt in a place hidden from the eyes of the people, and was committed by a murderer who was not known to the court — for had the murderer been known to them, they would have put him to death."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:21:51.733152769Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}